# Input

```svelte
<p><span>label</span><Input value={label} /><span>hint</span></p>

<p><span>label</span>{@render children?.()}<span>hint</span></p>

<p>{@render leading()}{@render children?.()}{@render trailing()}</p>

<p><span>label</span>{label}{description}<span>hint</span></p>

```


# Options

```json
{
	"formatter": {
		"lineWidth": 40
	}
}
```

# Formatted

```svelte
<p>
	<span>label</span><Input
		value={label}
	/><span>hint</span>
</p>

<p>
	<span
		>label</span
	>{@render children?.()}<span
		>hint</span
	>
</p>

<p>
	{@render leading()}{@render children?.()}{@render trailing()}
</p>

<p>
	<span
		>label</span
	>{label}{description}<span>hint</span>
</p>

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 40 characters
```
   16: 	{@render leading()}{@render children?.()}{@render trailing()}
```
